            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Whizbang 3.0.0 (17)

Uploads and downloads use the hosted files gateway for the full R2 switch. This build moves automatic updates to a signed feed that can advance independently of immutable installers. Builds 15 and 16 need one manual install of build 17 to migrate feeds.

Encrypted last-copy and delta foundations are integrated behind disabled switches while their remaining consumer acceptance checks are completed.
]]></description>
